o be part of the development and testing. His responsibility ended when he put the power of government behind the project, provided incentives and cleared the way for development in an attempt to slow or stop the "pandemic".\n\nCuomo still trusts the government agencies...and a cursory review of the 2020 health guidance should have utterly destroyed that trust. From masks, to suppression of all off-label prescriptions, to lock downs, to 6-foot separations and surface transmission...they got it all wrong.\n\nAs for vaccines, they never tested them to see if they prevented infection...but claimed they did. They constantly lied about efficacy in a waterfall decline of the percent effectiveness over months in 2021 and 2022.\n\nPfizer further used relative risk reduction versus absolute risk reduction to mislead the public regarding the effectiveness of the vaccine. This vastly overstated vaccine effectiveness, while risks were aggressively hidden (a process enabled by the inherent shielding of the Emergency Use Authorization.\n\nAdverse event reporting was clearly suppressed...and Pfizer wanted to lock up the files for 75 years. Birx\'s admissions of lying about efficacy were the final, but unnecessary, nail in the credibility coffin.\n\nThe entire experience was an exercise in lying and diversion.\n\nThe fact that 15,000 doctors supposedly don\'t want RFK, Jr. confirmed is prima facie evidence that they can\'t withstand and don\'t want scrutiny.\n\nCuomo should be ashamed of himself.  I will give him the benefit of the doubt and attribute it to indoctrination rather than stupidity.\n\nBut he has a lot of reading and studying to do to be ready to comment on these issues.\n\nHis "superior sources" are the problem, not the answer...and he doesn\'t know it.\n\nAnd that, in a nutshell, is why the legacy media and remnants therefrom are held in such disdain by the public.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'richtext